{
 "id": "have-got",
 "title": "Have / have got",
 "titleEn": "have and have got (possession)",
 "unit": "Основи речення",
 "level": "A1",
 "mistakeType": "word_order",
 "explanation": "Щоб сказати, що щось **маєш** (*У мене є…*), англійською кажуть **I have** або (британське, розмовне) **I have got**: *I **have** a car. = I'**ve got** a car.*\n\nУ 3-й особі: *she **has** / she'**s got***.\n\nЗаперечення і питання: з **have** — через do/does: *I **don't have** time. **Do** you **have** kids?*; з **have got** — без do: *I **haven't got** time. **Have** you **got** kids?*",
 "formula": [
  "I/you/we/they **have** = **'ve got**",
  "he/she/it **has** = **'s got**"
 ],
 "table": {
  "head": [
   "",
   "have",
   "have got"
  ],
  "rows": [
   [
    "+",
    "She has a dog.",
    "She's got a dog."
   ],
   [
    "−",
    "I don't have a car.",
    "I haven't got a car."
   ],
   [
    "?",
    "Do you have a pen?",
    "Have you got a pen?"
   ]
  ]
 },
 "examples": [
